<title>SINGAPORE: Jack Chia-MPH buys up food firms.</title>
<headline>Jack Chia-MPH buys up food firms.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jack Chia-MPH Ltd said on Wednesday it was buying stakes in two food companies from its joint venture partner U.S.-based Borden Inc for US$1.6 million.</p>
<p>It was buying the remaining 50 percent in Food &amp; Snack Holdings Singapore Pte Ltd and the remaining 15.5 percent of Borden Foods Malaysia Sdn Bhd, giving it full ownership of the two companies.</p>
<p>- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
